# Git LFS for the ONNX classifier.
#
# ml/export_edge/artifacts/classifier.onnx is ~16 MB, over GitHub's 10 MB
# limit for regular files, so it has to be stored with LFS.
*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Keep binary assets out of text diffs.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
